    m_Untranslated: Instructions
  Text:
    m_Untranslated: "<b>1.  Select the Web platform:</b>\n\n\_\_\_\_<b>\u2022</b> If the <b>Build Profiles</b> window is not already open, re-open it (<b>File</b> > <b>Build Profiles</b>).\n\n\_\_\_\_<b>\u2022</b> In the <b>Platforms</b> section, select <b>Web</b>.\n\n<b>2.  Switch platforms:</b>\n\n\_\_\_\_<b>\u2022</b> Select the <b>Switch Platform</b> button and wait for the process to complete.\n\n\_\_\_\_<b>\u2022</b> This process will take a few minutes.\n\n<b>Tip:</b> If the <b>Web</b> platform appears grayed out, select <b>Install with Unity Hub</b> and install the <b>WebGL Build Support</b> module before switching platforms.\n(You have to restart the Editor once install is completed)\n\nAfter this process is complete, your project assets and settings are configured for deployment to the Web platform."
  m_CriteriaCompletion: 0
  m_Criteria:
    m_Items: []
